      "message": "According the [picolibc documentation](https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/develop/languages/c/picolibc.html#building-without-toolchain-bundled-picolibc), you should create `platform/ec/zephyr/cmake/toolchain/coreboot-sdk/Kconfig` and add a symbol that does `select PICOLIBC_SUPPORTED`.\n\nAlternately, you could explicitly enable `TOOLCHAIN_HAS_PICOLIBC` in the coreboot-sdk [generic.cmake](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/HEAD:src/platform/ec/zephyr/cmake/toolchain/coreboot-sdk/generic.cmake;l\u003d1)\n\nExample [upstream](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/7fb2929e5ba058da82716b6555f75c112c252072/cmake/toolchain/espressif/generic.cmake#L56) that does this for newlib.",
